    <rdfs:label>non_sensitivity_governance_metadata</rdfs:label>
    <bfo:BFO_0000176 rdf:resource="http://example.org/llnl#governed_use"/>
    <skos:definition>[governed_use_required] export control, privacy, right &amp; release as it applies to the dataset as a whole, which may be distinct from the sensitivity or classification of the source data from which it was derived. Export Control &amp; Foreign National Access.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
