    <skos:definition>[discoverability_if_applicable] User facilities, HPC centers, or research infrastructure used to collect, process, or store the dataset. - name: __FACILITY_NAME__               # e.g., Spallation Neutron Source | Summit | Frontier ror_id: __ROR_ID__ role: - ${ROLE}                           # [discoverability_if_applicable] list from roles extending the CRediT taxonomy: Conceptualization | Data_Curation | Formal_Analysis | Funding_Acquisition | Investigation | Methodology | Project_Administration | Resources | Software | Supervision | Validation | Visualization | Writing_Original_Draft | Writing_Review_Editing | Data_Collection | Other location:                             # [discoverability_if_applicable] Point location for facility-based experimental data. description: __DESC__               # e.g., SNS Beamline 1B, Oak Ridge National Laboratory, TN, USA ror_id: __ROR_ID__                  # ROR ID of the facility; cross-reference with name above</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>facilities</rdfs:label>
